{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>朝中社於10月7日 報道，朝鮮領袖金正恩向俄羅斯總統普京（Vladimir Putin）發生日賀電。</p><p>報道指，金正恩在賀電中表示，與普京有良好的友誼，而且對於可和普京共同譜寫朝俄兩國關係發展新篇章感到高興。金正恩同時強調，與俄羅斯締造全面戰略夥伴關係、同盟關係，是朝鮮堅定不移的方針，亦是不變的選擇。</p><figure><img alt=\"朝俄關係：North Korean and Russian flags are displayed at the Moscow railway station for the arrival of North Korean leader Kim Jong il August 3, 2001 in Moscow, Russia. Kim Jong il will meet Russian President Vladimir Putin on August 4.（Getty Images）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240220/836576486352752640134620.jpeg/-FO4BdPGYISHcvdYFKTJw4zMU5jS1Ix_JTqF3CU6hdw\"/><figcaption>朝俄關係：North Korean and Russian flags are displayed at the Moscow railway station for the arrival of North Korean leader Kim Jong il August 3, 2001 in Moscow, Russia. Kim Jong il will meet Russian President Vladimir Putin on August 4.（Getty Images）</figcaption></figure><p>金正恩還在賀電中重申，對普京和俄羅斯的支持始終不變，又相信俄羅斯人會為國家主權、國安利益和領土完整的正義而奮戰，並達致勝利。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T02:00:32.490003+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":460,"images":1,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none"}}